      value: Truck Driver
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2200660650145078164, guid: 6a576fab062415742ba77588a2b7f7b7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: fullName
      value: Earl Thompson
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2200660650145078164, guid: 6a576fab062415742ba77588a2b7f7b7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: systemPrompt
      value: The Truck Driver is weary and conversational, mixing small talk with
        unsettling, cryptic remarks about the diner. He hints at seeing the previous
        worker and speaks as if the roadside kiosk is alive. His tone is grounded
        but uneasy, embodying the overlap of the mundane and the supernatural.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2200660650145078164, guid: 6a576fab062415742ba77588a2b7f7b7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: characterDescription
      value: "I\u2019m a tired trucker, always on the road. I stop here too often\u2014burgers,
        fries, cola to keep me going. This place feels colder than it should, like
        it\u2019s watching me. Sometimes I swear I\u2019ve seen the worker before
        you\u2026 or maybe I\u2019m too tired to know the difference."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
